// From the law, Article 3: yellow, blue, red in equal horizontal stripes, with eight white
// five-pointed stars in the middle of the blue, on an arc that is convex upward.
// From elsewhere: the law has no sizes. 2:3 is FOTW's. The arc and stars are measured from
// the Commons drawing's own transforms: circle center (90.03, 85.82), radius 36.72, stars
// of radius 5.19 at about 9.5, 28.5, 47.5 and 66.5 degrees either side of up.
vexyl 1
meta {
  name "Venezuela"
  date "2006-03-09"
  encoder "Naomi Persephone Amethyst"
  license "CC-BY-SA-4.0"
  render-license "CC0-1.0"
  source "https://docs.venezuela.justia.com/federales/leyes/ley-de-bandera-nacional-himno-nacional-y-escudo-de-armas-de-la-republica-bolivariana-de-venezuela.pdf"
  source "https://web.archive.org/web/20070113132248/http://www.asambleanacional.gov.ve/ns2/leyes.asp?id=722"
  source "https://www.crwflags.com/fotw/flags/ve.html"
  source "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Venezuela.svg"
  note "The law fixes the colors' order, the equal stripes, and the number and arrangement of the stars, not their sizes. Its Fourth Transitional Provision calls for a regulation on the flag's form and dimensions, which wasn't found. The proportion is FOTW's. The arc, star size and star rotation are from the Commons drawing and aren't legal values."
  note "The law gives no shades. The hex, Pantone and CMYK values are the Album des Pavillons 2023's, as reported by FOTW. White is plain white."
  note "This is the form with the eight stars only, which Article 3 gives the merchant marine. The form for the Presidency, the armed forces and public buildings adds the coat of arms at the hoist end of the yellow stripe, and isn't drawn here."
  note "The date is the Gaceta Oficial publication that FOTW reports, on which the law's final provision puts it in force. The gazette itself wasn't read."
  law "Law on the National Flag, National Anthem and Coat of Arms of the Bolivarian Republic of Venezuela, 2006, Article 3" {
    source "https://docs.venezuela.justia.com/federales/leyes/ley-de-bandera-nacional-himno-nacional-y-escudo-de-armas-de-la-republica-bolivariana-de-venezuela.pdf"
    source "https://web.archive.org/web/20070113132248/http://www.asambleanacional.gov.ve/ns2/leyes.asp?id=722"
  }
}
palette {
  yellow "#ffce00" {
    pantone "116 C"
    cmyk 0 19 93 0
  }
  blue "#0035ad" {
    pantone "286 C"
    cmyk 99 80 0 0
  }
  red "#d21034" {
    pantone "186 C"
    cmyk 10 100 74 2
  }
  white "#ffffff"
}
proportion hoist=120 fly=180

bars yellow blue red
charge star white {
  radius 5.19
  at fly=90.03 hoist=85.82
  repeat arc count=8 radius=36.72 from=-66.5 to=66.5 turn=#true
}
